<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1993</h1><p class="ref-lede">1993 in world history: 29 events, 18 deaths, 1 work, 4 states founded and 1 that came to an end. 260 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
