<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/andorra"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Andorra.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Andorra</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A new constitution is approved by referendum and Andorra joins the United Nations</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-belgium"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Belgium.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Belgium</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A constitutional reform makes Belgium a federal state</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/uganda"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Uganda.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Uganda</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The kingdoms are restored as cultural institutions</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-somaliland"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Somaliland.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Somaliland</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Borama conference chooses Muhammad Haji Ibrahim Egal as president</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/yoruba-religion"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Yoruba%20religion.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Yoruba religion</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Supreme Court of the United States upholds the right of a Santería church in Florida to practise animal sacrifice</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/mapuche"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mapuche.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mapuche</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Chile’s Indigenous Law officially recognises the Mapuche people, their language Mapudungun and their culture</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/azerbaijan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Azerbaijan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Azerbaijan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">President Abulfaz Elchibey is overthrown by a military insurrection led by Colonel Surat Huseynov, which brings Heydar Aliyev to power.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/armenia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Armenia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Armenia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Turkey joins Azerbaijan's railway and air blockade of Armenia; the new currency, the dram, is introduced and suffers hyperinflation.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/georgia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Georgia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Georgia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The civil war that began with the coup against Gamsakhurdia ends in December; Abkhaz separatists and North Caucasian militants expel some 230,000 to 250,000 Georgians from Abkhazia.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/principality-of-monaco"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Principality%20of%20Monaco.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Principality of Monaco</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Monaco becomes a member of the United Nations with full voting rights.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/colosseum"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Colosseum.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Colosseum</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A major restoration programme began, running until 2000</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/tao-te-ching"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Tao%20Te%20Ching.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Tao Te Ching</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Guodian Chu slips are found near Guodian in Jingmen, Hubei</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/dome-of-the-rock"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Dome%20of%20the%20Rock.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Dome of the Rock</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The gold covering of the dome was refurbished with funds from King Hussein of Jordan</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/prambanan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Prambanan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Prambanan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The main temples of the central zone were complete and inaugurated by President Suharto</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/himeji-castle"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Himeji%20Castle.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Himeji Castle</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The castle was registered as one of the first World Heritage Sites in Japan</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/american-indian-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/American%20Indian%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>American Indian Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">AIM splits into the Grand Governing Council and the International Confederation of Autonomous Chapters</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/santeria"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Santer%C3%ADa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Santería</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">In Church of the Lukumi Babalu Aye v. City of Hialeah the United States Supreme Court rules that animal cruelty laws aimed at Santería are unconstitutional</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/native-american-church"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Native%20American%20Church.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Native American Church</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Religious Freedom Restoration Act, with rulings such as US v. Boyll (1991), allows members to possess and use peyote for religious purposes</span></li></ul></section>
